her accessory. Her makeup features subtle blush, defined eyeliner, and glossy lips for a serene yet seductive expression.\n\nHer outfit combines gothic elegance with fantasy flair: she wears a black corset bodice with gold buttons down the front, paired with a high-cut white bustier top that reveals cleavage and is tied together with ornamental silver clasps. A sheer white cape or veil drapes over her shoulders and arms, while vertical straps with intricate metallic embroidery run along her sides like ceremonial armor panels.\n\nOn her thighs are thigh-high stockings (or lace-up legwear) in pristine white, each decorated with small gold filigree motifs near the knee area. She also sports matching gold armbands on both wrists—decorated with tiny star-like symbols—and wears a simple choker necklace featuring a dangling gemstone pendant.\n\nThe background consists of geometrically patterned walls formed by intersecting diagonal lines in off-white and charcoal gray tones, giving it a modern architectural feel reminiscent of futuristic temples or sacred halls. The lighting is warm but diffused—with highlights catching the edges of her costume, skin tone, and glowing halo—as if filtered through natural sunlight streaming into a cathedral space.\n\nOverall aesthetic blends elements of divine femininity, medieval mysticism, cyberpunk glamour, and intimate eroticism within clean cinematic composition suitable for adult-oriented digital art galleries or cosplayer portfolios. High detail focus on textures—from leather seams to fabric folds—to enhance realism despite its fantastical subject matter. Perfectly balanced color palette dominated by stark blacks, brilliant whites, gleaming gold accents, and ethereal warmth."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 106, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 84, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98